"nonexistent","job":"retired","count":37,"subscribed":2.0},{"contact":"telephone","campaign_band":"7+ contacts","poutcome":"nonexistent","job":"self-employed","count":45,"subscribed":2.0},{"contact":"telephone","campaign_band":"7+ contacts","poutcome":"nonexistent","job":"services","count":121,"subscribed":3.0},{"contact":"telephone","campaign_band":"7+ contacts","poutcome":"nonexistent","job":"student","count":15,"subscribed":0.0},{"contact":"telephone","campaign_band":"7+ contacts","poutcome":"nonexistent","job":"technician","count":147,"subscribed":6.0},{"contact":"telephone","campaign_band":"7+ contacts","poutcome":"nonexistent","job":"unemployed","count":42,"subscribed":0.0},{"contact":"telephone","campaign_band":"7+ contacts","poutcome":"nonexistent","job":"unknown","count":12,"subscribed":1.0},{"contact":"telephone","campaign_band":"7+ contacts","poutcome":"success","job":"entrepreneur","count":1,"subscribed":1.0},{"contact":"telephone","campaign_band":"7+ contacts","poutcome":"success","job":"housemaid","count":1,"subscribed":0.0}],"tables":[{"title":"Contact channel · full dataset","rows":[{"contact":"cellular","records":26144,"subscriptions":3853,"conversion_percent":14.74},{"contact":"telephone","records":15044,"subscriptions":787,"conversion_percent":5.23}]},{"title":"Contact frequency · full dataset","rows":[{"campaign_band":"1 contact","records":17642,"subscriptions":2300,"conversion_percent":13.04},{"campaign_band":"2–3 contacts","records":15911,"subscriptions":1785,"conversion_percent":11.22},{"campaign_band":"4–6 contacts","records":5229,"subscriptions":444,"conversion_percent":8.49},{"campaign_band":"7+ contacts","records":2406,"subscriptions":111,"conversion_percent":4.61}]}],"findings":["4,640 of 41,188 records show a subscription, a rate of 11.27%.","Cellular records have the higher descriptive channel rate at 14.74%; this is not a causal channel effect.","12 rows have identical values across the original fields. They are retained because no stable customer identifier establishes that they are duplicates."],"recommendations":["Report subscriptions alongside the number of contacted records so small groups do not look deceptively strong.","Treat channel and contact-frequency differences as questions for a controlled campaign test rather than proven effects.","For a future pre-call model, exclude call duration and evaluate precision, recall and PR-AUC against a simple baseline."],"limitations":["Historical Portuguese banking data, not current South African banking behaviour.","Contact frequency and channel are not random assignments. Differences may reflect customer selection and campaign timing.","No stable customer ID supports a unique-customer count, so the dashboard reports records.","This is descriptive analysis, not a predictive model. Call duration is excluded from published analysis fields to avoid suggesting pre-call availability."],"cleaning":["Chose bank-additional-full.csv: 41,188 original records and 21 fields; did not mix it with bank-full.csv or the 10% sample.","Excluded 0 invalid-target or non-positive-campaign records. Retained 12 exact attribute matches because they may be different customers.","Preserved unknown categories. Kept the previous-outcome non-existent category distinct from failure.","Binned campaign contacts into 1, 2–3, 4–6 and 7+. Omitted duration, raw customer attributes and economic covariates from the public cube."],"dictionary":[["contact","Telephone or cellular channel"],["campaign_band","Number of contacts in current campaign, including last contact"],["poutcome","Previous campaign outcome; non-existent is a separate category"],["job","Recorded job category; unknown retained"],["count","Number of records, not unique people"],["subscribed","Count of y=yes; rate denominator is count"]],"sql":"SELECT contact,campaign_band,COUNT(*) AS records,\n SUM(subscribed) AS subscriptions,100.0*AVG(subscribed) AS conversion_percent\nFROM read_parquet('analytics/cleaned/bank-campaign.parquet')\nGROUP BY ALL ORDER BY contact,campaign_band;\n-- Duration is deliberately excluded; it is unavailable before a call.","slug":"bank-campaign","credit":"Independent, AI-assisted portfolio analysis. Not client work."}